332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (FitTrack AI successfully resolves the limitations of manual fitness tracking by providing a robust, scalable backend for managing physical training routines. By pairing the lightweight efficiency of Node.js and Express with the flexible document storage of MongoDB, the platform delivers secure, low-latency API access for multi-user wellness environments. Integrating Google Gemini AI bridges the gap between raw data collection and actionable coaching, turning passive exercise logs into customized, safety-conscious training recommendations. The resulting system serves as a maintainable, high-performance foundation capable of powering modern digital health applications. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
